OpenWGT — an open engine for Widget Workshop

A free and open way to keep building widgets on today's computers. These are the people and pieces that bring it to the screen:


OpenWGT:

gustavn64
gustavn.se/openwgt

The port it builds on:

Doridian
github.com/Doridian/GadgetGenerator

OpenWGT adds its own free packs, all made for the project:

OpenWGFX
the pictures

OpenWSFX
the sounds

OpenWDATA
the texts

Built in Rust, with winit, wgpu and cpal

Free software:

OpenWGT is released under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any later version. You can read, change and share it.

Its fonts: MS Sans Serif and Small Fonts from Wine, under the GNU LGPL 2.1 or later, and Widget Sans, made from Liberation Sans, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.

Special thanks to:

everyone who kept their Widget Workshop CD
